    {
      "id": 63,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 760],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 32,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Characters: 4 views of a character with Qwen Image Edit 2511",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Characters: 4 views of a character with Qwen Image Edit 2511\n\nDraws your character from 4 views of one angle set in one run, one branch of Qwen Image Edit 2511 with the Multiple Angles LoRA at 0.9 and the Lightning LoRA per view, and saves the 4 images as one batch.\n\n## Models\n\n- [qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Edit_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8mixed.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2511, fp8 mixed, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511).\n- [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Qwen2.5-VL 7B text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct).\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors): Qwen Image VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI).\n- [qwen-image-edit-2511-multiple-angles-lora.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/fal/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Multiple-Angles-LoRA/resolve/main/qwen-image-edit-2511-multiple-angles-lora.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2511 Multiple Angles LoRA, by fal, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/fal/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Multiple-Angles-LoRA).\n- [Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning/resolve/main/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2511 Lightning 4-step LoRA, by lightx2v, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
